"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"立木主以薦之、何其愚且拙也、推此木主、與釋氏之","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u011","layer":"body","order":11,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"塑木像無異、不過塊然之物、全無補于世道人心、吾","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u012","layer":"body","order":12,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"從事乎孝道之際、叨蒙上帝默啟吾衷、知斯世之孝","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u013","layer":"body","order":13,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"行舛錯、死後之永罰難逃、讀上帝示人盡孝行於生","uncertainties":[{"candidates":["罰","罸"],"length":1,"offset":9,"reason":"縮圖上字形細部不清，未能分辨罰或罸"}]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u014","layer":"body","order":14,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"前之書、觀世人供木主於死后之舉、未嘗不感慨而","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u015","layer":"body","order":15,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"神傷矣、試思撫綏鞠育、父母之不敢少憚其劬勞者、","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u016","layer":"body","order":16,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"圖望子之有以慰於遲暮之秋也、爲人子者、果能体","uncertainties":[{"candidates":["圖","冀"],"length":1,"offset":0,"reason":"欄首字筆畫密集，縮圖上近「圖」，未能完全排除其他字形"}]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u017","layer":"body","order":17,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"親之心、養其身而兼养其志、不敢因家貧而頓改孝","uncertainties":[{"candidates":["养","養"],"length":1,"offset":9,"reason":"字形似簡寫「养」，與前文「養」字形不同，待局部圖確認"}]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u018","layer":"body","order":18,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"思、不敢因患難而更易孝行、誠如是、人子之職既盡、即","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u019","layer":"body","order":19,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"父母初何嘗逆望其子之禋祀乎、嘗聞讀蓼莪之詩、","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u020","layer":"body","order":20,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"停桑柘之社、古人讀詩觸景、而哀哭其父母者有之、","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u021","layer":"body","order":21,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"覩春露之既濡、睹秋霜之既降、君子感時物之推遷、","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u022","layer":"body","order":22,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"而思念其先人者又有之、人既若此、吾何爲獨不然、奈","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u023","layer":"body","order":23,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"何世之人每强爲其說曰、立先人之木主、設酒醴于其","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u024","layer":"body","order":24,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"前、謂非豐潔享祀、靈必格之乎、縱先人未必即來嘗、","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u025","layer":"body","order":25,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"亦可少盡人子一愾聞僾見之誠、噫迂矣、彼夫一舉","uncertainties":[{"candidates":["愾"],"length":1,"offset":7,"reason":"字形細部在縮圖上不清，暫讀作愾"}]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u026","layer":"body","order":26,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"足而不敢忘父母、一出言而不忘父母、人之稱斯孝","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u027","layer":"body","order":27,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"者、其謂之何、苟必待對越之餘、盡其誠、豆籩之旁","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u028","layer":"body","order":28,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"致其敬、人謂其孝也、吾謂其虛也、故吾願友生從","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u029","layer":"body","order":29,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"上帝耶穌之道、當及時盡孝、不可徒供木主以","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u030","layer":"body","order":30,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"疎分有父母者之孝思可矣、爲人子者、誠不忘","uncertainties":[{"candidates":["疎","踈"],"length":1,"offset":0,"reason":"欄首字偏旁在縮圖上未能確定"}]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u031","layer":"body","order":31,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"父母之深恩、可將父母生平之善狀、詳著於族","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u032","layer":"body","order":32,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"譜、俾後世子孫、有志于述志繼事者、可瞭然于","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u033","layer":"body","order":33,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"body","text":"心目也、","uncertainties":[]},{"bbox":null,"gaps":[],"id":"p001-u034","layer":"imprint","order":34,"page_id":"p001","review_status":"ai-initial-unreviewed","role":"imprint","text":"丁未廈門刻","uncertainties":[]}]}
